nd code words.\nPreserve each actor, pronoun, attribution, named object, action, condition, quantity, date, question, negation, uncertainty, and requested or forbidden action. Do not switch you/I/he, convert a question or dialogue request into narration, invent an event, or remove valid manner/context details. Names, titles, code, paths, numbers and dates retain their source spelling. Relevant spelling edits have already been explicitly applied where supported; do not guess further entity spellings.\nImprove punctuation, spacing and clearly supported grammar/function-word inflections. Remove meaningless hesitation and genuine repetition, retaining meaningful opinion and politeness. If a source word or fragment is unclear, keep its wording rather than substituting a guessed action/name or completing an unseen clause. Do not modernize literary dialect or infer missing facts. Distinct exclusions and contrasts must remain, even if a value also implies them. Only an explicit withdrawal/correction cue permits removing the obsolete value. No completion claims, invented requirements, headings or signatures. Return only the edited source text in its original language(s).\nPreserve every dictated fact and request, including completed/ongoing/not-started status and details explicitly kept unchanged. Write status/background as natural sentences. Tasks may use bullets: keep an owner, their task and their individual deadline in the same item. Only genuinely shared times or conditions go in a separate final sentence applying to all relevant tasks. Remove only meaningless oral restarts, not quoted repetition or repeated names describing different actions. Add no information.\nFor the FINAL input, preserve each phrase in its existing language, including mixed Han/Latin text and code. Do not translate the whole text into either language. Only copyedit the source.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"先核对 syncQueue，暂时不要动权限。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对 syncQueue，暂时不要动权限。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"The audit is complete, packing is still in progress, Noor handles packing, Devin checks labels, contact the courier after both checks finish.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nThe audit is complete. Packing is still in progress.\n\n- Noor handles packing.\n- Devin checks labels.\n\nContact the courier after both checks finish.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"盘点结束了，装箱还在进行，小岑负责装箱，小佟检查标签，都检查完再联系承运方。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n盘点结束了，装箱还在进行。\n\n- 小岑负责装箱。\n- 小佟检查标签。\n\n都检查完再联系承运方。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"交付由周一改周三，审批通过再发送，接收人和格式都不变。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n交付由周一改为周三，审批通过再发送；接收人和格式都不变。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Move delivery from Monday to Wednesday, send only after approval, keep the same recipients and format.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nMove delivery from Monday to Wednesday. Send only after approval. Keep the same recipients and format.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"trackQueue 的状态，trackQueue 的状态先确认，不改默认值。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先确认 trackQueue 的状态，不改默认值。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Jules checks inventory and Morgan packs the orders, begin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- Jules checks inventory.\n- Morgan packs the orders.\n\nBegin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小陆核对账目，小何整理凭证，下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小陆核对账目。\n- 小何整理凭证。\n\n下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Zion prepares receipts and Remy checks figures, receipts are due Monday and figures are due Thursday.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- Zion prepares receipts, due Monday.\n- Remy checks figures, due Thursday.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小商整理采购单，小莫复核付款，采购单周一交，付款周四确认。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小商整理采购单，周一交。\n- 小莫复核付款，周四确认。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"先看 writeCache 的超时，只查原因，不清缓存。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
